8. **[scripts/land/lib.sh:9-13,155-156](file:///tmp/claude-30035/-home-unbalancedparen-projects-concrete2/e2c54e65-31b5-4145-8101-c2d7b071b97e/scratchpad/agy/scripts/land/lib.sh#L9-L13) — PREFERENCE (missing `land_url_expand` in header comment; case-sensitive `.git` suffix strip)**
